  {
   "team": "BUF",
   "tag": "Result",
   "text": "Bills 23, Vikings 6. Buffalo controlled the ball for 42 minutes and forced three Minnesota turnovers; Carson Wentz and the Vikings managed 178 yards and two field goals. The model's locked pick, Buffalo at 56%, won. Its spread side (Vikings +3.5) and total (Over 45.5) both lost.",
   "src": "Final score and team stats, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/game/_/gameId/401873051/bills-vikings"
  },
  {
   "team": "LA",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Puka Nacua has MCL and PCL sprains in his right knee plus turf toe, and Sean McVay says he'll likely go on injured reserve. That means at least four games; with the Week 11 bye, Dec. 20 at Dallas is the earliest return. He's out of the fantasy rankings and his snaps now count in the Rams' injury load.",
   "src": "Larry Brown Sports (via NFL Network), Nov 9",
   "url": "https://larrybrownsports.com/football/rams-news-puka-nacua-injury/777778"
  },
  {
   "team": "JAX",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Jacksonville made three defensive trades in one day: DT Jordan Davis from Philadelphia (2027 first-round and 2029 second-round picks), S Jessie Bates from Atlanta (2027 second, 2028 fifth) and DT Davon Godchaux from New Orleans. Team ratings catch up as the new players take snaps.",
   "src": "ESPN, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50435639/jaguars-get-eagles-jordan-davis-blockbuster-trade"
  },
  {
   "team": "LAC",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Justin Herbert hurt his left middle finger in the loss to Houston. Jim Harbaugh said it 'could be a fracture' pending Monday's tests; Herbert said he doesn't expect it to be a problem. The model assumes he starts next Monday at Baltimore.",
   "src": "The Big Lead, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.thebiglead.com/jim-harbaugh-justin-herbert-injury-update-finger-week-9-loss/"
  },
  {
   "team": "DAL",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "TE Jake Ferguson and RB Tyler Goodson will miss multiple weeks, and S P.J. Locke is out for Sunday against San Francisco, per Brian Schottenheimer. George Pickens and Kavontae Turpin are among those to be decided later in the week.",
   "src": "A to Z Sports, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://atozsports.com/nfl/dallas-cowboys-news/injury-updates-jake-ferguson-tyler-goodson-pj-locke/"
  },
  {
   "team": "DET",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Detroit acquired S Andre Cisco from the Jets for a 2028 sixth-round pick.",
   "src": "Detroit News, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://detroitnews.com/story/sports/nfl/lions/2026/11/09/detroit-lions-trade-andre-cisco-stats-new-york-jets-safety/92693765007"
  },
  {
   "team": "MIN",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Kyler Murray (hamstring) is out tonight and week-to-week. Carson Wentz starts against Buffalo.",
   "src": "Vikings.com",
   "url": "https://www.vikings.com/news/quarterback-carson-wentz-monday-night-bills"
  },
  {
   "team": "CLE",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Deshaun Watson cleared the concussion protocol and is expected to start Sunday against Houston. The model now uses Watson instead of Shedeur Sanders.",
   "src": "NFL.com news roundup, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-news-roundup-latest-league-updates-from-monday-nov-9"
  },
  {
   "team": "SEA",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Drew Lock hurt his oblique in the Week 9 win and already has elbow tendonitis. Sam Darnold (hamstring) is being monitored, and Jalen Milroe is next if neither can go. The model still assumes Lock.",
   "src": "Yahoo Sports NFL live updates, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/live/nfl-news-injury-updates-trade-deadline-rumors-131950109.html"
  },
  {
   "team": "KC",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "Patrick Mahomes has elbow soreness after a hit against the Jets. An MRI showed no major injury, and Andy Reid called him day-to-day. The model assumes he plays at Atlanta.",
   "src": "KCTV5, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.kctv5.com/2026/11/09/andy-reid-says-patrick-mahomes-is-day-to-day-after-injury-against-jets/"
  },
  {
   "team": "NYG",
   "tag": "QB",
   "text": "J.J. McCarthy has a hip pointer but is expected to play Thursday against Washington. RB Cam Skattebo should be back from his hamstring injury.",
   "src": "NFL.com news roundup, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-news-roundup-latest-league-updates-from-monday-nov-9"
  },
  {
   "team": "GB",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Josh Jacobs is expected to miss up to three weeks. He's removed from projections, and his snaps now count in Green Bay's injury load.",
   "src": "Yahoo Sports NFL live updates, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/nfl/live/nfl-news-injury-updates-trade-deadline-rumors-131950109.html"
  },
  {
   "team": "NE",
   "tag": "Injury",
   "text": "Rhamondre Stevenson had knee imaging Monday; no results yet. A.J. Brown has missed two games, and Mike Vrabel said the plan is for him to travel to Germany for Sunday's game against Detroit, with no final decision. Lineman Ben Brown won't make the trip.",
   "src": "NFL.com news roundup, Nov 9",
   "url": "https://www.nfl.com/news/nfl-news-roundup-latest-league-updates-from-monday-nov-9"
  },
  {
   "team": "IND",
   "tag": "Trade",
   "text": "Jonathan Taylor is still a Colt. The belief around the league is that Indianapolis will take the best offer before Tuesday's 4 p.m. ET deadline.",
